  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>pomalidomide</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>L04AX06</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>one compartment, oral dosing <small>(PK_1C_enteral)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Ogasawara K et al. 2021</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>pediatric patients with recurrent or progressive primary brain tumors</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>pomalidomide</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_pomalidomide/Pomalidomide_Ogasawara2021_reference\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>CL/F (L/h)</td><td>3.92</td><td>L/h</td><td><small>CL/F</small></td></tr><tr><td>V/F (L)</td><td>42.7</td><td>L</td><td><small>V/F</small></td></tr><tr><td>Ka (h -1 )</td><td>0.759</td><td>h -1</td><td><small>kabs</small></td></tr><tr><td>Absorption</td><td>0.380</td><td></td><td><small>Fab</small></td></tr></table><h4>About pomalidomide</h4><p>Pomalidomide is an immunomodulating and anti-angiogenic medicine used to treat multiple myeloma, and has also been studied for conditions such as amyloidosis, myelofibrosis, and plasma cell leukemia. It is approved and authorised in the European Union, where several pomalidomide products are on the market.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q7227206\">Wikidata Q7227206</a> and the WHO ATC classification and the EMA medicines list; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Pomalidomide\">Pomalidomide</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Ogasawara K et al. (2021). Recurrent or progressive pediatric brain tumors: population pharmacokinetics and exposure-response analysis of pomalidomide. <i>Pediatric research 90(4):832–839</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41390-020-01304-6\">10.1038/s41390-020-01304-6</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33469186\">33469186</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Ogasawara_2021: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
